        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also subject to laws, regulations, and rules governing the provision of online payment services, the design and operation of our platform, and the operations, characteristics, and quality of our platform and services.",
