        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The system for trust that we designed continues to include core components such as host and guest reviews, account protection, risk scoring, secure payments, a nondiscrimination policy, watchlist and background checks in certain jurisdictions, cleanliness, fraud and scam prevention, insurance and similar protections, booking restrictions, an urgent safety line, a 24/7 neighborhood support line, anti-party technology, and a guest refund policy.",
